==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Lost Thunder|Electabuzz|71}} from the {{TCG|Lost Thunder}} expansion.
*'''Thunder Spear''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Sandstorm|Electabuzz|35}} from the {{TCG|EX Sandstorm}} expansion. 
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

